    "tr069-client": {
      "badge": "proven",
      "vendor": "Works Systems OneAgent TR",
      "role": "CPE CR",
      "findings": [
        "The Nokia FastMile binary matches the full 401 template. ASUS build files name OneAgent TR; ASUS and openagent-2.0 sources identify Works Systems as the author.",
        "qop/no-qop are component build variants: Nokia includes a qop placeholder; ASUS omits it. The response does not identify the device OEM.",
        "Observed sub-families: DigAuth with an Apache-style Server header, 64-character nonce and Date; TR069 Client with a custom Server header, 31-character nonce and no Date."
      ],
      "anomalies": [
        "Response evidence does not establish a hardware model or exploitability."
      ],
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "DEANON-TR069CLIENT.md"
